findings.body:
`process.env.PROCESSOR_KEY` is included in the debug log payload on every charge. That value is a payment-processor credential: once it hits the logging pipeline it is readable by anyone with log access and can be used to replay charges.

Support correlation only needs non-secret charge context (`orderId`, `ref`). Restore those fields and drop the key entirely.

```suggestion
  // non-secret charge context for support correlation on failures
  log.debug("charge context", { orderId: order.id, ref });
```
